  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II SALHSA Health Systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SALHSA project will create a Latin America hub for health systems and policy research through the development and implementation of a comprehensive postgraduate study programme. It aims to address the four systemic and key challenges of the region: 1) Health system governance and regulation, 2) Health system financing and programme evaluation, 3) Epidemiological training and primary health care, and 4) Health system financing and managerial abilities.</narrative>
  </description>
